WEBVTT

03:30.600 --> 03:35.120
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

03:41.880 --> 03:42.920
Jie, you are back.

03:46.600 --> 03:47.560
Jie?

03:48.320 --> 03:49.520
You are back.

03:50.400 --> 03:51.840
We met in Yanggou Village before.

03:51.920 --> 03:52.800
My surname is Yang.

03:52.880 --> 03:54.000
I'm Mr. He's comrade.

03:54.800 --> 03:55.760
I took the liberty

03:55.840 --> 03:57.080
of setting up the funeral hall

03:57.160 --> 03:58.960
with the funeral parlor staff.

03:59.040 --> 04:01.760
Please forgive me
if I overlooked anything.

04:02.640 --> 04:03.880
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

04:04.360 --> 04:05.440
Where is my mom?

04:05.520 --> 04:06.920
She has been with Zhangyue.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.720
She is probably in the embalming room.

04:10.920 --> 04:12.400
I'll take a look at the funeral hall.

04:12.480 --> 04:14.200
Let me know if you need me to do anything.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.240
All right.

04:26.840 --> 04:27.800
Ms. Liao.

04:33.120 --> 04:34.600
Do you want some water?

04:36.800 --> 04:38.000
I'm not thirsty.

04:38.080 --> 04:39.120
No, thanks.

04:40.760 --> 04:42.040
Mr. He's 3D facial reconstruction

04:42.120 --> 04:43.080
will take some time.

04:43.680 --> 04:45.160
You can look at the details

04:45.640 --> 04:46.920
to feel more assured.

04:48.400 --> 04:51.800
I'm sorry to butt in on everything.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.480
Don't be.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.720
This is a matter of course.

04:55.640 --> 04:56.720
Take your time.

04:57.280 --> 04:58.360
No rush.

05:00.200 --> 05:01.080
All right.

05:40.280 --> 05:41.880
Are these made

05:41.960 --> 05:43.840
for those who died in accidents?

05:45.000 --> 05:46.200
Yes.

05:49.680 --> 05:51.240
The advantage of 3D printing is that

05:51.320 --> 05:53.080
it can conceal all disfigured parts

05:53.160 --> 05:54.920
in the shortest time possible.

05:55.680 --> 05:57.480
Especially in cases like Mr. He,

05:58.160 --> 05:59.240
manual restoration

05:59.880 --> 06:01.040
is rather difficult.

06:02.200 --> 06:03.400
Can you understand this?

06:08.200 --> 06:09.520
After the mold is done

06:09.600 --> 06:11.000
and placed on the deceased,

06:11.560 --> 06:13.640
we will proceed with facial makeup

06:13.720 --> 06:14.640
and detail restoration.

06:15.200 --> 06:17.000
This allows the family

06:17.080 --> 06:18.400
to see a familiar face

06:18.480 --> 06:19.840
when they say goodbye.

06:22.040 --> 06:23.240
This technology

06:24.280 --> 06:26.400
is more advanced
than that of over ten years ago.

06:35.960 --> 06:37.240
My first husband

06:37.960 --> 06:39.320
died in a car accident.

06:43.880 --> 06:45.040
I'm sorry for your loss.

06:54.120 --> 06:55.600
My husband

06:57.760 --> 06:59.240
was pretty meticulous.

07:00.400 --> 07:01.680
Please…

07:01.760 --> 07:03.280
Please take care of him.

07:07.080 --> 07:08.160
Don't worry.

07:09.760 --> 07:10.720
I will.

07:28.360 --> 07:31.320
OUR DEAREST
HE ZHANGYUE'S GRACE LIVES ON

07:35.440 --> 07:37.080
GREAT VIRTUE ENDURES

07:37.160 --> 07:40.760
RETURN TO THE EARTH FULFILLED,
BLESS THE DESCENDANTS ABUNDANTLY

07:43.760 --> 07:44.720
Jie,

07:45.600 --> 07:47.120
there is a condolence money desk

07:47.200 --> 07:48.400
and registration desk.

07:49.440 --> 07:50.560
Mr. He had a lot of friends.

07:50.640 --> 07:51.640
There will be many guests.

07:51.720 --> 07:54.120
If you don't have any special requests,

07:55.160 --> 07:56.240
I will handle it.

08:00.880 --> 08:02.280
I'm fine with it.

08:02.360 --> 08:03.440
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

08:03.520 --> 08:04.960
Don't be so courteous with me.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.840
-Besides, you'll--
-Jie.

08:23.080 --> 08:24.240
Niaoniao.

08:28.520 --> 08:29.360
Jie,

08:31.920 --> 08:34.039
have I lost my dad too?

08:37.480 --> 08:38.600
Jie.

08:55.640 --> 08:56.720
Mr. Yang,

08:57.760 --> 09:00.000
if you have any instructions
for the three of us,

09:00.560 --> 09:01.880
please tell us.

09:03.760 --> 09:05.080
Tomorrow,

09:05.160 --> 09:06.520
we will send Mr. He off properly.

09:06.600 --> 09:08.320
Someone has to go home

09:08.400 --> 09:09.560
to issue an obituary.

09:10.560 --> 09:11.960
Zhuang Yan will do this.

09:12.520 --> 09:14.480
According to our local tradition,

09:15.040 --> 09:17.040
it has to be done by the son.

09:17.840 --> 09:19.240
Zhuang Yan will do it.

09:21.120 --> 09:23.480
But I'm not Mr. He's biological son.

09:24.040 --> 09:25.560
Maybe Niaoniao could do this.

09:25.640 --> 09:27.360
Niaoniao is too young.

09:29.200 --> 09:30.640
Some of the procedures

09:31.680 --> 09:32.920
may be too difficult for her.

09:40.600 --> 09:42.440
But I'm afraid

09:42.520 --> 09:43.600
my identity isn't suitable.

09:43.680 --> 09:45.480
If Mr. He gets upset…

09:51.920 --> 09:53.760
Have you forgotten how Mr. He treated you?

09:55.800 --> 09:58.120
He won't be upset if you send him off.

10:02.640 --> 10:04.520
He will issue the obituary
as the eldest son.

10:05.360 --> 10:06.240
All right.

10:06.960 --> 10:08.320
Let's split up

10:09.240 --> 10:10.240
and proceed.

10:10.720 --> 10:11.760
Mr. Yang,

10:13.000 --> 10:14.360
don't worry about the cost.

10:16.120 --> 10:18.200
I will give Mr. He
the most dignified funeral.

10:21.080 --> 10:22.920
Okay. Let's go.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.200
Zhuang Yan, take Niaoniao home

10:28.680 --> 10:30.520
and do what Mr. Yang said.

10:30.600 --> 10:31.840
Come back here afterward.

10:32.920 --> 10:34.600
We will keep vigil for Mr. He.

11:14.360 --> 11:15.440
Mr. He,

11:16.480 --> 11:17.760
I am now going

11:18.920 --> 11:20.120
to trim your fingernails.

11:58.320 --> 11:59.480
It trims off

12:01.320 --> 12:03.000
your worries and doubts

12:06.200 --> 12:07.560
as well as

12:09.440 --> 12:11.280
your mundane troubles.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.240
Mr. He,

12:17.040 --> 12:18.600
please move on peacefully.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.160
My condolences.

13:03.240 --> 13:04.360
Thank you.

13:04.440 --> 13:06.160
-Jie, please stay.
-Thank you.

13:06.240 --> 13:07.680
Just tell me if you need anything.

13:07.760 --> 13:08.680
Thank you.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.320
Take care.

13:10.880 --> 13:11.960
Thank you.

13:12.040 --> 13:13.200
I'm leaving.

13:16.560 --> 13:18.400
Please take care, girl.

13:50.960 --> 13:52.400
I'm lucky

13:52.880 --> 13:54.200
to have you guys.

14:12.160 --> 14:16.400
REGISTRATION

15:05.400 --> 15:07.320
Please put the shoes on for the deceased.

15:25.720 --> 15:27.640
Zhangyue, I'm putting shoes on you.

19:21.520 --> 19:22.360
Mr. He,

19:22.440 --> 19:24.120
if I get recognized by the town later,

19:24.200 --> 19:25.680
I'll give you an appreciation pennant.

19:25.760 --> 19:27.520
-Sure.
-That's right.

19:27.600 --> 19:30.720
THE GREAT MAN OF THE HOUSE

19:32.960 --> 19:34.040
Mr. He,

19:36.400 --> 19:38.600
I promised I would
give you an appreciation pennant

19:40.920 --> 19:45.320
if the town government honors me.

19:46.600 --> 19:48.520
I had Niaoniao order this.

19:49.400 --> 19:50.480
I planned…

19:58.000 --> 20:00.680
I planned to hold a grand celebration

20:02.280 --> 20:05.040
during the New Year and give it to you.

20:18.520 --> 20:20.920
It seems I can only give it to you now.

20:33.920 --> 20:39.920
HONOR MR. HE ZHANGYUE WITH THE TITLE
OF "THE GREAT MAN OF THE HOUSE"

20:54.360 --> 20:55.560
Mr. He,

20:57.520 --> 21:00.240
without you,
how will this family carry on?

21:21.480 --> 21:22.720
You are not made of iron.

21:23.440 --> 21:24.600
Get some rest.

21:28.760 --> 21:30.040
Chen Maidong,

21:31.640 --> 21:35.160
I have never once called him "Dad".

21:36.520 --> 21:37.720
He won't blame you.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.160
You don't understand.

21:42.480 --> 21:43.760
You don't.

21:47.320 --> 21:49.040
Mr. He is gone.

21:53.240 --> 21:55.080
He is gone.

21:58.000 --> 21:59.440
Don't cry here.

22:00.320 --> 22:01.720
You will wake your siblings up.

22:29.480 --> 22:30.520
Dad.

23:07.120 --> 23:08.280
Chen Maidong,

23:10.880 --> 23:13.160
do I really bring bad luck?

23:14.280 --> 23:15.760
Don't say silly things.

23:17.400 --> 23:19.200
I had already lost my dad,

23:21.120 --> 23:23.480
so I cherished Mr. He very much.

23:24.480 --> 23:26.440
I never dared to call him Dad.

23:28.640 --> 23:29.960
Still,

23:31.160 --> 23:32.520
he has left.

23:34.520 --> 23:37.200
My mom and I think it's our fault.

23:40.600 --> 23:42.640
Sometimes, the good die young

23:44.440 --> 23:46.680
because Heaven thinks they are too tired

23:47.560 --> 23:48.960
and gives them an early rest.

23:54.840 --> 23:56.040
I can't understand.

23:58.680 --> 23:59.920
I really can't.

24:01.120 --> 24:03.000
No one is born already knowing it.

24:05.640 --> 24:07.440
I have been in this industry
for a long time.

24:08.440 --> 24:10.880
It was only a few months ago
that I realized something

24:10.960 --> 24:12.400
through a young boy.

24:12.480 --> 24:14.240
That the people closest to us

24:15.360 --> 24:17.840
will one day leave us.

24:20.160 --> 24:21.600
For example, my grandma.

24:38.720 --> 24:39.640
Zhuang Jie,

24:41.720 --> 24:43.960
parting with our closest ones

24:45.680 --> 24:48.320
may be a signal from Heaven

24:48.400 --> 24:49.880
to remind us.

24:51.520 --> 24:53.920
After the most reliable barrier vanishes,

24:55.040 --> 24:56.760
it will be our turn sooner or later.

24:59.120 --> 25:01.040
Life has its limits.

25:02.040 --> 25:04.360
That's why we should strive hard to live,

25:05.240 --> 25:07.720
create, and love.

25:09.440 --> 25:11.880
If life were to carry on forever,

25:12.880 --> 25:14.640
it would actually be quite boring.

25:18.080 --> 25:20.000
But why me again?

25:21.760 --> 25:23.280
Why does it always have to be me?

25:27.880 --> 25:28.880
I'm sorry.

25:31.320 --> 25:33.200
I can't answer that.

25:51.560 --> 25:52.600
Chen Maidong,

25:55.320 --> 25:56.760
have you ever

25:57.400 --> 25:59.200
lost someone in your life?

26:07.040 --> 26:08.640
When I was 17,

26:11.680 --> 26:13.200
my best friend

26:15.160 --> 26:16.560
died right before me.

26:21.240 --> 26:22.480
His name was Song Ran.

26:23.960 --> 26:25.200
When he died,

26:26.560 --> 26:27.840
he was also 17.

26:32.000 --> 26:33.400
Before Song Ran died,

26:34.400 --> 26:35.840
he called me.

26:37.080 --> 26:38.080
But I missed it.

26:39.720 --> 26:41.960
To be honest, I was just lazing around.

26:43.200 --> 26:45.280
I was playing video games
at the cyber cafe.

26:46.840 --> 26:48.240
Song Ran

26:49.560 --> 26:51.200
had never been in a fight before.

26:52.760 --> 26:53.920
That was the first time.

26:56.960 --> 26:58.040
So,

26:59.960 --> 27:01.480
even now,

27:03.760 --> 27:04.880
I still blame myself

27:05.680 --> 27:06.960
for his death.

28:09.280 --> 28:11.400
You are saying silly things too.

28:12.560 --> 28:13.720
No, I'm serious.

28:14.360 --> 28:15.880
Every day since Song Ran's passing,

28:15.960 --> 28:17.040
I have wondered

28:18.120 --> 28:19.720
why it had to be my friend who died

28:21.400 --> 28:23.480
and why I had to witness that scene.

28:25.920 --> 28:27.760
If people could die like that,

28:29.640 --> 28:31.360
what is the purpose of living?

28:34.200 --> 28:36.200
Do you have an answer now?

28:39.040 --> 28:40.280
Someone

28:41.920 --> 28:43.240
gave me the answer.

31:47.440 --> 31:48.640
All right.

31:52.520 --> 31:53.960
Your feet are clean.

31:56.760 --> 31:58.520
You are clean too.

32:02.760 --> 32:04.640
Stop messing around from now on.

32:17.760 --> 32:20.160
Those who are meant to leave
will eventually leave.

32:20.880 --> 32:22.200
We can't keep them.

32:27.000 --> 32:29.280
"Those who are meant to leave
will eventually leave.

32:30.520 --> 32:31.760
We can't keep them."

32:34.440 --> 32:35.720
So,

32:37.000 --> 32:38.840
did you decide
to enter the funeral industry

32:40.720 --> 32:42.960
because of this man?

32:44.600 --> 32:45.640
Yes.

32:47.360 --> 32:48.560
He told me

32:49.880 --> 32:51.760
that death always happens suddenly.

32:52.840 --> 32:54.240
Being upset is useless.

32:55.440 --> 32:58.600
Someone has to do something.

33:00.000 --> 33:01.200
In that case,

33:01.840 --> 33:03.400
is he your master?

33:06.480 --> 33:10.040
I have learned various professional skills
from many experts.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.880
But only he

33:12.640 --> 33:13.760
is my master.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.680
VOCATIONAL SKILLS LEVEL CERTIFICATE

33:35.760 --> 33:38.800
VOCATIONAL SKILLS LEVEL CERTIFICATE

33:39.600 --> 33:41.800
NAME: CHEN MAIDONG
PROFESSION: EMBALMER

33:46.920 --> 33:49.520
NAME: CHEN MAIDONG
PROFESSION: EMBALMER

34:19.719 --> 34:21.719
What is your master doing now?

34:22.480 --> 34:23.920
He must be retired.

34:24.840 --> 34:26.000
He…

34:29.280 --> 34:30.639
He is gone.

34:37.719 --> 34:39.159
He had bad habits

34:41.400 --> 34:43.480
and no one was around to take care of him.

34:44.360 --> 34:47.000
He called me one weekend

34:47.080 --> 34:48.520
and proudly promised

34:49.520 --> 34:50.800
to take me hiking

34:50.880 --> 34:52.960
when I returned to Nanping
during the New Year.

34:54.600 --> 34:55.920
The next day,

34:56.000 --> 34:57.600
he passed away.

34:57.680 --> 35:01.240
BEIJING

35:16.160 --> 35:17.520
At the age of 17,

35:19.040 --> 35:20.960
Master helped me send Song Ran off.

35:23.200 --> 35:24.760
At the age of 27,

35:26.360 --> 35:28.080
I left Beijing for Nanping

35:29.840 --> 35:31.600
and sent him off myself.

35:34.520 --> 35:35.880
Because of Song Ran,

35:37.400 --> 35:39.240
I refuse to forget about death.

35:42.560 --> 35:43.760
Because of Master,

35:45.760 --> 35:47.680
I learned to help more people

35:49.120 --> 35:50.960
leave this world with dignity.

35:58.680 --> 35:59.880
Therefore, Zhuang Jie,

36:01.680 --> 36:02.840
the nature of loss

36:03.960 --> 36:06.360
teaches us to slowly accept.

36:09.000 --> 36:10.680
I know you are suffering.

36:13.000 --> 36:14.520
But you will get through it.

36:21.800 --> 36:22.800
Like you?

36:26.760 --> 36:27.720
Yes, like me.

36:42.000 --> 36:45.720
BEING MORTAL,
WE CAN ONLY LESSEN OUR GRIEF

36:45.800 --> 36:51.680
BEING MORTAL,
WE CAN ONLY LESSEN OUR GRIEF

36:51.760 --> 36:57.680
BEING MORTAL,
WE CAN ONLY LESSEN OUR GRIEF

38:22.640 --> 38:24.680
Those who are meant to leave
will eventually leave.

38:25.680 --> 38:26.880
We can't keep them.

38:29.440 --> 38:30.760
Being mortal,

38:33.480 --> 38:34.920
we can only lessen our grief.

39:10.560 --> 39:16.200
PARDON US IF WE FAILED TO INFORM YOU
THE HE FAMILY IS IN MOURNING

39:16.280 --> 39:22.280
PARDON US IF WE FAILED TO INFORM YOU
THE HE FAMILY IS IN MOURNING

42:37.760 --> 42:44.440
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
